- Spy watcher cannot be to the right of family watcher, so spy watcher must be in position 1 (same) or to the left (no position to the left of 1).
- So spy watcher must be in position 1.

But two people cannot be in the same position, so family watcher and spy watcher cannot both be in 1.

Therefore, family watcher cannot be in 1.

Similarly, if family watcher is in position 3 (odd), radish eater is also in 1 or 3 (odd).

Spy watcher cannot be to the right of family watcher (position 3), so spy watcher must be in position 1 or 2.

This is possible.

