- Person at position 3: odd

And family watcher and radish eater are both in odd positions (positions 1 and 3).

# Final concise answer:

Positions 1 and 3 are odd parity; position 2 is even parity.

Family watcher and radish eater both occupy odd parity positions (positions 1 and 3).

Spy watcher occupies position 1 or 2, not to the right of family watcher.

