From (1), either the goldfish owner drinks juice or the goldfish owner watches adventure, but not both.

Since the goldfish owner is the gardener (not cola drinker), and drinks juice or watches adventure.

If the goldfish owner drinks juice, then they do not watch adventure.

If the goldfish owner watches adventure, then they do not drink juice.

Now, the goldfish owner is the gardener.

